CB008940 Verification of UL PRB Demand
    Dated Log New Line    Verification of UL PRB Demand for each cell
    Step    Verify PRB Demand is within a range of min and max values
    ...                                                         nrCell_id=0x4001
    ...                                                         direction=Ul
    ...                                                         traffictype=${COL_NAME_NOGBRPRBREQUEST} 
    ...                                                         min_prb_value=0
    ...                                                         max_prb_value=273

    Step    Verify PRB Demand is within a range of min and max values
    ...                                                         nrCell_id=0x4001
    ...                                                         direction=Ul
    ...                                                         traffictype=${COL_NAME_GBRPRBREQUEST}
    ...                                                         min_prb_value=0
    ...                                                         max_prb_value=273    

