# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#                                           Panda Extract                                        
Panda Extract Csv For PRB Pooling
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is not based on argument
    ...     Actions:        it extracts the requested information from the Sherpa micro__l1l2Trace.csv input
    ...     Checks:         it needs no checks
    ...     Verdict:        csv files are created containing the information
    [Arguments]
    Dated Log     ${sherpa_output_path}
    ${file_path_micro_l1l2} =      Set Variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/micro__l1l2Trace.csv
    Dated Log     ${file_path_micro_l1l2}
    PandasCsv.Setup Reader     ${file_path_micro_l1l2}    # Load data from a csv file using pandas library
    PandasCsv.Extract Cvs Files Forcolumn    filter_column=TEXT    
    ...                                      by_value=MSGID
    ...                                      filter=PrbPoolingAllocationReport(45)
    ...                                      list_grp=None
    ...                                      csv_sep=;
    PandasCsv.Extract Cvs Files Forcolumn    filter_column=TEXT
    ...                                      by_value=MSGID
    ...                                      filter=PrbPoolingAllocationSubpool(45)
    ...                                      list_grp=None
    ...                                      csv_sep=;

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#                                          Traffic                                                 
DL Traffic SA Not Stopped with "${throughput}"Mbps "${duration}"s duration and "${deviation}" percent deviation
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the arguments ${param} ${ueSetting}
    ...     Actions:        it manages the DL traffic on the UE
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        DL traffic is passed

    Set To Dictionary       ${current_elem}        trf_id    ${current_elem.ue}
    Traffic UE DL           ueSetting=${current_elem}
    ...                               throughput=${throughput}
    ...                               captureCallback=None
    ...                               capture=None
    ...                               captureDuration=0
    ...                               duration=${duration}
    ...                               shouldBeStop=False
    ...                               shouldBeCheck=False
    ...                               deviation=${deviation}

UL Traffic SA Not Stopped with "${throughput}"Mbps "${duration}"s duration and "${deviation}" percent deviation
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the arguments ${param} ${ueSetting}
    ...     Actions:        it manages the DL traffic on the UE
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        DL traffic is passed

    Set To Dictionary       ${current_elem}        trf_id    ${current_elem.ue}
    Traffic UE UL           ueSetting=${current_elem}
    ...                               throughput=${throughput}
    ...                               captureCallback=None
    ...                               capture=None
    ...                               captureDuration=0
    ...                               duration=${duration}
    ...                               shouldBeStop=False
    ...                               shouldBeCheck=False
    ...                               deviation=${deviation}

DL Traffic GBR SA Not Stopped with "${throughput}"Mbps "${duration}"s duration and "${deviation}" percent deviation
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the arguments ${param} ${nbOfUe} ${ueSetting}
    ...     Actions:        it manages the DL traffic GBR on the UE
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        DL traffic is passed

    # Step 1 on qfi=2 with protocol tcp
    Set To Dictionary       ${current_elem}        trf_id    2
    Set To Dictionary       ${current_elem}        qfi       2
    Traffic UE DL           ueSetting=${current_elem}
    ...                               throughput=${current_elem.DL_throughput_GBR}
    ...                               captureCallback=None
    ...                               capture=None
    ...                               captureDuration=0
    ...                               duration=${duration}
    ...                               shouldBeStop=False
    ...                               shouldBeCheck=False
    ...                               deviation=${deviation}
    ...                               protocol=tcp
    # Step 2 on qfi=3 with protocol udp
    Set To Dictionary       ${current_elem}        trf_id    3
    Set To Dictionary       ${current_elem}        qfi       3
    Traffic UE DL           ueSetting=${current_elem}
    ...                               throughput=${current_elem.DL_throughput_GBR}
    ...                               captureCallback=None
    ...                               capture=None
    ...                               captureDuration=0
    ...                               duration=${duration}
    ...                               shouldBeStop=False
    ...                               shouldBeCheck=False
    ...                               deviation=${deviation}
    ...                               protocol=udp

Get Number Of Ue Configured With GBR Traffic
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the argument ${dict_ues}
    ...     Actions:        it returns the number of ue's configured with GBR traffic
    ...     Checks:         it checks that the requested GBR throughput for the ue's is different from 0
    ...     Verdict:        the number of ue's configured with GBR traffic is returned
    [Arguments]             ${dict_ues}

    ${current_value}        Set Variable        0
    FOR    ${current_ue}    IN      @{dict_ues}
        ${current_value}=     Run Keyword If    ${current_ue.DL_throughput_GBR} > ${NO_THROUGHPUT}
        ...                                               Evaluate    ${current_value} + 1
        ...                               ELSE            Evaluate    ${current_value} + 0
    END
    Dated Log               The number of ue's configured with GBR traffic is ${current_value}
    [Return]                ${current_value}

Set RAD Params Of 8940-Q-B2
    [Documentation]     Add Rad params of CB8940 & CB7113 & CB8941 features
    ...                 will be removed and replaced later by NIDD params
    ...                 0x58057A=4 : L2 feature flags : ERR & WRN & INF & DBG
    ...                 0x580117   # crs-rs send req in sherpa
    ...                 0x420068=7 : rdFeatureFlagBitmap1 : 
    ...                 bit 2 -> CB007113 : 1  (enabled)
    ...                 bit 1 -> CB008847 : 1 (enabled)
    ...                 bit 0 -> CB008940 : 1 (enabled)
    ...                 0x580690=1  # rdAllowZeroAllocByPass - 0 : ZAB Disabled - 1 : Enabled
    ...                 0x58066a=1  # InterL1SubPool         - 0 : Disabled - 1 : Enabled
    ...                 CB008941 flags: 
    ...                 0x600012=0  # CB8941 BOAM_NRTS
    ...                 0x5901C9=0  # CB8941 L3_rdUlUpFragmentationEnable in L3
    ...                 0x5901CA=0  # CB8941 L3_rdDlUpFragmentationDisabled in L3
    ...                 0x190297=0  # OAM_FEAT_RUMAG_CB008941
    ...                 0x190305=1  # CB8941 BOAM_RUMAG UL enable
    ...                 0x190306=1  # CB8941 BOAM_RUMAG DL enable
    ...                 0x800067=1  # enablePoolingFourSubcellSupport
    ...                 0x580001=0  # Disable HARQ incremental redundancy DL
    ...                 0x580678=2  # Maximum number of NACKs received at gNB for a HARQ process
    ...                 0x580010=0x10000000   # rdSupportedUlMCS Hardcode Ul Mcs to 28
    Dated Log New Line   Add RAD params of 8940-Q InterL1SubPool and ZeroAllocationByPass are enabled
    ${rad_param_1}=       create dictionary       field=0x580117    value=1
    ${rad_param_2}=       create dictionary       field=0x420068    value=7
    ${rad_param_3}=       create dictionary       field=0x580690    value=1
    ${rad_param_4}=       create dictionary       field=0x58066a    value=1
    ${rad_param_5}=       create dictionary       field=0x600012    value=1
    ${rad_param_6}=       create dictionary       field=0x5901C9    value=1  
    ${rad_param_7}=       create dictionary       field=0x5901CA    value=1
    ${rad_param_8}=       create dictionary       field=0x190305    value=1
    ${rad_param_9}=       create dictionary       field=0x190306    value=1
    ${rad_param_10}=      create dictionary       field=0x800067    value=1 
    ${rad_param_11}=      create dictionary       field=0x580001    value=0
    ${rad_param_12}=      create dictionary       field=0x580678    value=2
    ${rad_param_13}=      create dictionary       field=0x580010    value=0x10000000             
    ${rad_param_list}=       Create List         
    # ...                                          ${rad_param_1}
    # ...                                          ${rad_param_2}
    # ...                                           ${rad_param_3}
    # ...                                          ${rad_param_4}
    # ...                                          ${rad_param_5}
    # ...                                          ${rad_param_6}
    # ...                                          ${rad_param_7}
    # ...                                          ${rad_param_8} 
    # ...                                          ${rad_param_9}           
    # ...                                          ${rad_param_10}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_11}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_12}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_13}
    Dated Log New Line       RAD params :        ${rad_param_list}
    SetConfig.Set Fields in swconfig DU       param_list=${rad_param_list}
    Dated Log New Line   RAD params of 8940-Q-B2 update completed
